  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5b1d6a85",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "The cleaned interaction data has been structured into a relational SQLite database containing separate user, artist, album and interaction tables.\n",
    "\n",
    "This database can now be used to query listener behaviour and analyse activity at user, artist and album level before moving into recommendation modelling."
   ]
  }
